        "travel :parameters (?traveler - (either creature character) ?from - place ?to - place) :precondition (and (not (= ?from ?to)) (alive ?traveler) (at ?traveler ?from)) :effect (and (not (at ?traveler ?from)) (at ?traveler ?to)))": "(:action travel :parameters (?traveler - (either creature character) ?from - place ?to - place) :precondition (and (not (= ?from ?to)) (alive ?traveler) (at ?traveler ?from)) :effect (and (not (at ?traveler ?from)) (at ?traveler ?to)))",
